    "body": "# Force (Kinetic Subtype)\n\n**Category**: Damage Types & Energy Profiles\n\n## Overview\nForce damage is a specialized kinetic subtype consisting of concentrated kinetic fields, telekinetic pressure, and directed gravitic displacement.\n- **Armor Penetration**: **Ignores 1/2 of Target Armor DR** automatically, making it exceptionally effective against fortified armor plates and heavy carapaces.\n\n### Metaphysical\n- **Telekinetic Blast**: Direct concussive projections of pure mental willpower.\n- **Repulsor Wave**: Concentrated force pulses that shatter structures and repel targets.\n\n### Modern & Advanced Tech\n- **Concussive Force Projectors**: Directed acoustic or gravitic shockwaves.\n- **Kinetic Field Emitters**: Devices compressing atmospheric air into high-density kinetic projectiles.\n\n### Tactical Notes\nBecause Force damage bypasses half of Armor DR, it serves as the premier anti-tank and anti-fortification kinetic damage vector."
