    "modifiers": [],
    "body": "# Psyche / Mental Damage\n\n**Category**: Damage Types & Energy Profiles\n\n## Overview\nMental damage targets the conscious mind, neural synapses, and psyche rather than the physical flesh.\n- **Armor Bypass**: **Completely ignores Physical Armor DR**. Resisted exclusively by mental discipline, **Willpower Saves**, and psychic wards.\n\n### Metaphysical\n- **Psychic Assault**: Projecting pure telepathic force into an adversary's brain, inflicting agony or unconsciousness.\n- **Emotional Manipulation**: Flooding enemy minds with panic, despair, or uncontrollable frenzy.\n- **Mental Intrusion & Mind Blast**: Shattering conscious thought, inducing amnesia, or seizing motor control.\n\n### Advanced Tech\n- **Psychic Amplifiers**: Neural headgear amplifying the psionic output of trained espers.\n- **Neural Disruptors**: Electromagnetic microwave beams scrambling brain synapses to cause disorientation and blackout.\n- **Mind Control Transceivers**: Cybernetic overrides commanding enemy nervous systems.\n\n### Tactical Notes\nMental attacks induce the **Dazed** (1 action/turn, no reactions) or **Stunned** status on failed saves, making them devastating against heavily armored brutes with low mental defenses."
